 "system": "adaptintake",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I have a cough."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When did you first notice the cough?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Two days ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me how bad your cough has been and how much it’s affecting you day to day, and whether you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "The cough is dry."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me about any medicines you take regularly or have taken recently—including what they are and how much you take—and about any health conditions you have now or had in the past, operations, or hospital stays?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I have high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines, no known allergies, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No allergies. My daughter took me shopping last week."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much is your cough affecting your day-to-day life — not at all, a little, or a lot, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What else came with the cough?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've had body aches."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Which of these best describes your medicines right now — you take only regular medicines, you have started or changed a medicine recently, you take no medicines, or you're not sure? If you know, please include the dose."
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just my regular medicines. Can't remember the dose."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Where do you feel the cough, and does it move?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I haven't noticed anything like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is your cough for you right now — mild, moderate, severe, or you're not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Not sure."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you noticed anything that seems to make your cough worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing makes it worse. My grandson visits on Sundays."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is your cough there all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I haven't really noticed."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What would you most like us to help you with today about your cough?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "The pain in my right side."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides high blood pressure, is there anything else about your past health — like other ongoing conditions, past illnesses, operations, or hospital stays — that you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I had pneumonia last year, it cleared up."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Has your cough changed anything about your sleep?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My eyes bother me sometimes, the macular degeneration."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've been feeling nauseous."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else about your past health, like any operations, that you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, no operations that I know of."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Has your cough affected your daily activities a lot, a little, or not at all, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Not sure. I've felt feverish with chills."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Are there any other symptoms you've noticed that you'd like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "The pain only comes with coughing."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
